OL,3,GNEWSARNLI sees supporter boost after
OL,4,Aabuse of volunteers
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, it said it was "so
OL,7,Fgrateful" for its supporters, adding
OL,8,Fthat it had also been contacted by "a
OL,9,Fnumber of supporters and members of the
OL,10,Fpublic" who were withdrawing their
OL,11,Fsupport.
OL,13,FIt comes as a rally was held near the
OL,14,Fcharity's headquarters in Poole,
OL,15,FDorset, in support of its service.
